sers/jojoe77777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojoe77777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/java-archive","state":"uploaded","size":9975622,"digest":"sha256:e0c607559f2539bda840f9a18a47fd6e96ba67f6ef0d1a7b82a94faf24b430fb","download_count":90,"created_at":"2026-09-06T04:20:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-06T04:35:26Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/releases/download/v1.4.4/Toolscreen-1.4.4-double-click-me.jar"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/tarball/v1.4.4","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jojoe77777/Toolscreen/zipball/v1.4.4","body":"NOTE: This version's file name is 1.4.5, but will show up in the game as 1.4.4, as only the installer was changed in 1.4.5\r\n\r\nToolscreen 1.4.4 is now available\r\n\r\nSetup video: https://youtu.be/YqS-fxPx_jo\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n- Hermes game-state detection\r\n- Per-color opacity in ninjabrain overlay\r\n- Visual configurator: drag and resize overlays directly on screen\r\n- Traditional Chinese translation\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n- Performance issues + log spam in newer versions/draftout instances\r\n- Keep custom cursor when opening the gui\r\n- Cursor visibility issues on alt-tab\r\n- Custom cursor flicker on newer mc versions\r\n- Low-level suppressed keys not detected in hotkey exclusion\r\n- Key stays held if mode changes before released\r\n- Right shift keeping left shift held\r\n- Mirror color picker live preview without obs/virtual camera\r\n- Color picker only changing first target color\r\n- Plus sign not showing in mirror groups spinner\r\n- Boat not showing on nbb overlay blind results\r\n- Hide cursor visibility controls when trail disabled\r\n- Boat icon size for compact preset\r\n- Ninbot overlay hidden in sourceless modes\r\n- Black screen from render hook exception\r\n- Hide user paths in GUI\r\n- Handle custom Modrinth location paths\r\n\r\n**How to update: If you're on 1.0.6 or higher, just launch your instance and it will prompt you to update\r\nOtherwise download the .jar below, put it in the instance folder, and double click it**\r\n\r\nReport bugs and suggestions in the Discord: https://discord.gg/A2v6bCJg6K\r\n\r\n## Patreon\r\nIf you would like to support the future development of Toolscreen, you can [subscribe through Patreon](https://www.patreon.com/jojoe77777), your name will show up in the Supporters tab of Toolscreen and you get access to exclusive supporter discord channels\r\n"}